` v0.70.0 → v0.72.0, `github.com/bborbe/cqrs` v0.5.2 → v0.6.0\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":6,"newStart":7,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ## Unreleased"," ","+- test: add Ginkgo suite bootstrap for root command package"," - refactor: move Kafka SyncProducer construction from factory.CreateSyncProducer to entry point"," "," ## v0.1.3"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
